sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Cliente
    participant R as Router (Express)
    participant Z as Zod (schemas)
    participant S as Service
    participant D as Domain (evaluation.js)
    participant P as Prisma
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    C->>R: POST /api/v1/assessments/:id/grades {studentId, score}
    R->>Z: validate(createGradeSchema, body)
    alt payload inválido
        Z-->>R: 400 VALIDATION_ERROR {details}
        R-->>C: 400 envelope de erro
    end
    Z-->>R: payload validado
    R->>S: createGrade(assessmentId, body)
    S->>D: validateScore · validateWeight
    D->>D: weightedAverage + resolveResultStatus
    S->>P: prisma.$transaction(async tx => ...)
    P->>DB: INSERT grade + UPSERT result
    DB-->>P: ok
    P-->>S: commit (notas + resultado atómicos)
    S->>D: serialização gradeDto
    S-->>R: gradeDto
    R-->>C: 201 {data, meta{cross correlationId}}

    rect rgb(253, 245, 245)
        Note over S,DB: alt (falha -> ROLLBACK)
        Note over S,DB: NOT_FOUND 404 · CONFLICT 409 (duplicado, OPEN, peso/maxScore imutável)
        Note over S,DB: VALIDATION_ERROR 400 · P2002→409 · erro inesperado→500
    end